Package: space.kern0x1b.rev
Name: Revenant WebKit
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A modern WebKit engine underneath the phone's own Safari.
 Builds WebKit 2.54 for armv7 / iOS 6.1.3 and loads it beneath Mobile Safari, so
 the browser renders today's web: modern CSS and layout, Web Crypto, WebAssembly,
 inline video and audio, and TLS this release cannot otherwise speak.
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Author: kern0x1b
Maintainer: kern0x1b
Icon: file:///Library/PreferenceBundles/RevPrefs.bundle/icon@2x.png
